{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KfG_zvxvJj3U5aTl6xKeCg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:00.871141+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KfG_zvxvJj3U5aTl6xKeCg","html":"<div><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/eFDF8tqt5M83S5Tnl5VibCG5iaUhp3khicQ2DFiaTVWe3ywAdd1SdvBtFXZOK4GgbicJEkgIZPkvgoOe8yicYOMQicm5w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>交大安泰优才营<br/>(2026年入学)</span></span><br/><span>全面启动</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>关于安泰</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/eFDF8tqt5M83S5Tnl5VibCG5iaUhp3khicQ9ia0SXGgicF9tR7nXwHpqn6OD0Yvt7TNzIzedked3SncJaMlJicSWwaMw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/eFDF8tqt5M83S5Tnl5VibCG5iaUhp3khicQzLw6ThDZOPomh3yTUYOoc6yth65O7eVRPvMlMUC66ticfADKicGKvWOw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p>上海交通大学安泰经济与管理学院是一所国内领先、亚洲一流、国际知名的商学院。1901年的“经济特科班”和1918年的 “铁路管理科”，是学院建设的起点。经过百年的发展，上海交通大学安泰经济与管理学院已稳居中国最顶尖商学院方阵。交大安泰是国内首家同时获得AMBA、EQUIS、AACSB三大国际权威认证的商学院，拥有全国顶尖的生源和教学科研团队，并在上海、深圳、新加坡构建了国际化办学格局。如今，进入第二个百年征程的交大安泰，正以“纵横交错、知行合一”战略为指导，迈上了建设“扎根中国的世界级商学院”的登峰之路。</p><p><br/></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>学科排名</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/eFDF8tqt5M83S5Tnl5VibCG5iaUhp3khicQgqrYbuUicqcEl33CqDfckvEVkicnuGqSYbU6pIxiaQp12yHD4VtAVJY0g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/eFDF8tqt5M83S5Tnl5VibCG5iaUhp3khicQmzh0Q2gppWny4dDPXI4Nle8V4j5LTJLnu39yNm4AsdrdibFMFWVwVuQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/eFDF8tqt5M83S5Tnl5VibCG5iaUhp3khicQ06ILm2HCDvtfM0Y3IvKeMIPbrqSvbgNVKtW0Juc7IRumdbYoAiaN7mQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/eFDF8tqt5M83S5Tnl5VibCG5iaUhp3khicQwOBKZecYKTNquxdfX4ntGNHKzPghOffEIWRGEdjZ0icWBevDicDHdI2g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>安<span>泰优才营举办时间和形式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4OTQ2NzkzOA==&amp;mid=2649912378&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=e4f99940e80af3f064879beffa8a3062&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4OTQ2NzkzOA==&amp;mid=2649912378&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=e4f99940e80af3f064879beffa8a3062&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\"><span>上海交通大学安泰经管学院第二十届（2026入学）安泰优才营将于2025年春夏季举办，分为春季营会计专硕营、夏令营会计专硕营、夏令营学术营（学硕、直博），将采用线下方式举办（如有变化另行通知）。</span></a></p></section></section></section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>优才营<br/>名称</span></strong><strong><span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>举办<br/>时间</span></strong><strong><span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>可申请<br/>专业</span></strong><strong><span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>可申请的<br/>研究方向</span></strong><strong><span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>学制</span></strong><strong><span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>金融<br/>第一批</span><span></span></span><strong><span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><span><span>4</span><span>月<br/></span><span>12-13</span><span>日</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>金融专硕</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>行业研究与产业金融、</span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>金融科技与量化投资、</span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>科创金融</span><span></span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>2</span><span>年</span><span></span></span><strong><span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>金融<br/>第二批</span><span></span></span><strong><span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><span><span>5</span><span>月<br/></span><span>17-18</span><span>日</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><span>金融</span><p><span><span>第三批</span><span></span></span><strong><span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><span><span>7</span><span>月<br/></span><span>11-13</span><span>日</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>会计<br/>春季营</span><span></span></span><strong><span></span></strong></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>5</span><span>月</span><span>25</span><span>日</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>会计专硕</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>不区分研究方向</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>2</span><span>年</span><span></span></span><strong><span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>会计<br/>夏令营</span><span></span></span><strong><span></span></strong></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>7</span><span>月<br/></span><span>6-8</span><span>日</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>会计专硕</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>不区分研究方向</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>2</span><span>年</span></p></td></tr><tr></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>学硕<br/>夏令营</span><span></span></span><strong><span></span></strong></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span></p><p><span><span>8-10</span><span>日</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>工商管理学</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>不区分研究方向</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2.5</span><span>年</span><span></span></span><strong><span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>管理科学与工程</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>不区分研究方向</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2.5</span><span>年</span><span></span></span><strong><span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>应用经济学</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>经济学</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2.5</span><span>年</span><span></span></span><strong><span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>直博<br/>夏令营</span><span></span></span><strong><span></span></strong></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>7</span><span>月<br/>8</span><span>-11</span><span>日</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>工商管理学</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>企业战略管理、市场营销与战略、供应链与物流管理、组织行为和人力资源管理、会计与公司治理等</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>5</span><span>年</span><span></span></span><strong><span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>管理科学与工程</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>金融工程及风险管理、优化与运作管理、信息系统及管理、技术创新及管理、大数据计算与挖掘(大数据及商业管理)等</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>5</span><span>年</span><span></span></span><strong><span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>应用经济学</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>金融学、产业经济学、国际经济与贸易、数量经济学、农业经济学、区域经济与城市经济等</span><span></span></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>5</span><span>年</span><span></span></span><strong><span></span></strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span>注：</span></p><p><span>1、以上时间安排如有变动，以后续通知为准。</span></p><p><span>2、除金融专硕第二批（5月17-18日）在北京举办之外，其它各营均在上海举办。</span></p><p><span>3、金融专硕优才营仅能入营一次，未入营可继续申请金融专硕后续批次或安泰任何其它项目优才营。</span></p><p><span>4、会计专硕优才营仅能入营一次，未入营可继续申请会计专硕后续批次或安泰任何其它项目优才营。</span></p><p><span>5、获得7月份之前安泰任何批次的“优秀营员A”资格的同学，在不放弃“优秀营员A”资格的前提下，不可再申请后续的安泰优才硕士营，但可申请直博营。</span></p><p><span>6、入营7月份之前安泰任何批次而未获“优秀营员A”资格的同学，仍可申请除原项目外的夏令营其他项目；若两个项目都获“优秀营员B”资格，以首先转为“优秀营员A”资格的项目为优先，其它项目的“优秀营员B”资格自动取消。</span></p><p><span>7、各项目7月份的批次（夏令营及金融第三批），因时间临近，只能申请其中的一个专业或方向。</span></p><p><span>8、上海交大安泰经管学院将根据教育部和学校相关政策保留最终解释权。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>会计专硕、学硕、直博在安泰经管学院考生系统中统一报名<br/>https://apply.acem.sjtu.edu.cn/postgraduate/login<br/><span></span></span></p></section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section><section><p><span>春季营（会计专硕）报名时间：<br/>2025年4月16日—2025年4月28日<br/>夏令营（会计专硕、学硕、直博）报名时间：<br/>2025年5月8日—2025年6月16日</span></p><p><span>请同学们注意截止时间，不接受逾期报名。报名提交后将不可修改，请上传最终版材料。</span></p></section><section><p><br/></p><p><span>金融硕士在中银科技金融学院网报系统中报名<br/>https://applyitf.sjtu.edu.cn/apply/jrzs/#/login</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>申请资格</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1、拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></p><p><span>2、本科三年级在校生（2026年应届毕业生），专业不限（欢迎跨专业报考）；</span></p><p><span>3、能获得本科所在院校的推免研究生资格；<br/></span><span>4、英语水平优秀。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>联系方式</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>安泰经管学院教务办公室</span></strong></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>地  址：上海市徐汇区华山路1954号，上海交大安泰经济与管理学院B301室</span></p><p><span>邮  编：200030</span></p><p><span>电  话：021-52305272 (会计专硕)、52301352 (直博、学硕)、52301031</span></p><p><span>邮  箱：acem.zhaosheng@sjtu.edu.cn<br/></span><span><br/><strong><span><strong><span>中银科技金融学院教学服务中心（金融硕士）</span></strong></span></strong></span><strong><span><strong><span><br/></span></strong></span></strong><span><br/>地  址：上海市徐汇区华山路1954号，<span>上海交通大学浩然高科技大厦605室</span></span></p><p><span>邮  编：200030</span></p><p><span>电  话：<span>021-62933105、021-62933016</span></span></p><p><span>邮  箱：<span>itf.mf@sjtu.edu.cn</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>安泰优才，智创未来！</strong></span></p><p><span><strong>热切期盼各校优秀学子，相聚上交！</strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/eFDF8tqt5MibWC46zGmO0xfXYqFWia5yk2kI3c0hxBpibpykw1j7ibJRCIAudWF66ic3WRpuJV5ib52COKPRFLhIsQzA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/><section><br/></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4OTQ2NzkzOA==&amp;mid=2649924566&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5e8212616058113267cf313769290a26&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4OTQ2NzkzOA==&amp;mid=2649924566&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5e8212616058113267cf313769290a26&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\"><section><p>• 上海交大安泰经管学院学术型硕士项目介绍</p></section></a><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4OTQ2NzkzOA==&amp;mid=2649924587&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=f8def7f99504fd95b633008f24ed036c&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" titl